=== Text #2 ===
> Our Chalets and Log Cabins are set in their own beautifully landscaped woodland grounds in Blairgowrie, the heart of the Perthshire Highlands. This private park is only 5 minutes’ walk from the town centre and provides a perfect destination for your holiday break. Explore the great outdoors with a wealth of golfing, fishing, skiing, walking and cycling opportunities in and around the local area.
Our site is always being updated with news and offers, so please check back regularly. In the meantime if you want to get in touch you can email us by clicking here, or call us on 01250 872464.[][][][][][]

